#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0146 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "The only way this rule can be made to skip: declared OCCDS beats the PARAM/PARAMCD BDS detection (Fix #154), giving structure set [OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE], not the rule's single Include token. Data is the invalid fixture's, i.e. it would fire if it ran."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADLBC structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col PARAM   type=Char
col PARAMN  type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | ALB   | Albumin    | 1
S1 | 002 | ALB   | Albumin    | 1
S1 | 003 | ALB   | Bilirubin  | 1
S1 | 004 | CREAT | Creatinine | 2
S1 | 005 | CREAT | Creatinine | 2
